# Requests of the extra of lab 3.3 (REV-6), in the order of "Check it" in the lab booklet.
# Start first: your review-service, started fresh.
@reviewUrl = http://localhost:8083

### A review for event 1, 5 stars
POST {{reviewUrl}}/api/events/1/reviews
Content-Type: application/json

{"author": "Alice", "stars": 5, "text": "Wonderful."}

### A review for event 1, 4 stars
POST {{reviewUrl}}/api/events/1/reviews
Content-Type: application/json

{"author": "Ben", "stars": 4, "text": "Very good."}

### A review for event 1, 2 stars
POST {{reviewUrl}}/api/events/1/reviews
Content-Type: application/json

{"author": "Cleo", "stars": 2, "text": "Too loud."}

### Only 4 stars and more
GET {{reviewUrl}}/api/events/1/reviews?minStars=4

### All reviews
GET {{reviewUrl}}/api/events/1/reviews

### minStars 0
GET {{reviewUrl}}/api/events/1/reviews?minStars=0

### minStars 6
GET {{reviewUrl}}/api/events/1/reviews?minStars=6

### minStars abc
GET {{reviewUrl}}/api/events/1/reviews?minStars=abc
